			"notes": "# Spotify Lyrics Mod v1.0.0\n\nThe first release of Spotify Lyrics Mod for Minecraft Fabric!\n\n### Features\n- Automatic Spotify song detection.\n- Synchronized lyrics using LRCLIB.\n- Real-time in-game lyrics HUD.\n- Customizable HUD position and scale.\n- Lyrics synchronization offset adjustment.\n- In-game settings screen.\n- Keyboard shortcuts to toggle the HUD and open settings.\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft Java Edition 26.2\n- Java 25\n- Fabric Loader\n- Fabric API\n- Spotify Desktop application\n\n### Installation\n1. Download `spotifylyrics-1.0.0.jar`.\n2. Place it inside your Minecraft `mods` folder.\n3. Launch Minecraft using Fabric.\n4. Open Spotify and play a song.\n\nEnjoy synchronized lyrics while playing Minecraft!"
		}
